#: includes/class-admin-notice-manager.php:171
msgid "Those copies will keep running their current prompts, tools and risk levels — plugin updates will not reach them. If you did not create them on purpose, rename or remove the directories and the bundled versions will load again. Nothing is changed for you: that folder is yours."
